    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your prayer stirs one of Ursun&rsquo;s servants. One bear within range will not attack unless attacked and will answer any questions you pose it, drawing from its own knowledge (not Ursun&rsquo;s). Its voice is sonorous and noble, and it speaks in the mother tongue of the priest. Once it has answered all of your questions, it will return to the forest. If required, it will fight by your side to the death and return to the forest once the battle has ended.</p>"
